  "display_title": "Enoch: The Shining Tree",
  "description": "*\"You shall live and suffer for eternity, trapped within your armor, prisoners of time.\"*\n\nEnoch's life is turned upside down when his entire family is slaughtered overnight by the cursed knights. The knights wander, sentenced by the witch's curse to a fate of endless empty slaughters. Enoch trampled under their trail of blood, burns for a vengeance that outlasts, outdoes eternity. Who will be whose fate? Who is the one that orchestrates their conflicting fates?\n\n(Source: WEBTOON)",
